# Everything excluded here is excluded from the BUILD CONTEXT, which means it can never
# end up in a layer even by mistake. The two groups below have different reasons.

# ── Must never enter the image: secrets and local data ───────────────────────
# A developer's .env holds OATHRION_SESSION_SECRET, OATHRION_KEK and console passwords. A local
# data.db holds real rows. Both would be baked into a layer and would survive any later
# deletion, because layers are additive.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
data.db
data.db-shm
data.db-wal

# ── Excluded because they would be wrong or wasteful, not because they are secret ──
# node_modules: the image installs from the lockfile instead. Copying a host tree would
# bring in native binaries compiled for the host's libc and defeat determinism.
node_modules
dist
.vite

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Build artefacts and reports from local runs.
*.log
.mutation-backup
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Documentation is not needed by the running server.
AUDIT-REPRISE.md
*.md
!package.json

.DS_Store
